{
  "name": "tipton-lottery",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 86.768,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "You wrote the program that picks the lottery numbers, so what stops you from winning?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.761,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "ac5ee9007b61"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Eddie Tipton's employer had an answer.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.724,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d03c79ab514"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The draw computers sat in a locked glass room, on camera, never on the internet.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.451,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d03c79ab514"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "There were two of them, and officials flipped a coin to choose one.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.794,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d03c79ab514"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "And staff like Tipton could not even collect a prize.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.633,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d03c79ab514"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Tipton was the security expert.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.041,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He had warned a national conference about programs that secretly change how a computer works.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.343,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In November twenty ten, he went into that room to change the clocks.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.164,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That day, the camera was malfunctioning.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.714,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "It recorded one second out of every minute.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.49,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Nobody in the room saw anything unusual.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.917,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "They relied on his expertise.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.5,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3089a49c523e"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Thirty-three days later, someone bought a ticket at a Des Moines convenience store.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.547,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Six days after that, it hit the jackpot.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.063,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Sixteen and a half million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.829,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "And nobody came.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.731,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then, almost a year later, a man in Quebec called.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.212,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He knew the ticket's fifteen-digit number.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.751,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But his story did not match the store's video.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.945,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Next came a blind trust in Belize.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.881,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then, about an hour before the deadline, a lawyer walked in with the ticket.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.019,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Still no name.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.706,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.5,
      "text": "The lottery refused to pay.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.187,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3a4dd35d061a"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "For almost three years, nobody had a name.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.993,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "23db7eb84dc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So investigators released the store's video.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.866,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "23db7eb84dc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Six days later, a lottery employee in Maine sent a tip.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.812,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "23db7eb84dc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "The man buying that ticket, the tip said, was Eddie Tipton.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.102,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He said he had been in Houston.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.229,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then in twenty seventeen, he told a court about his code.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.476,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On certain days, it made the numbers predictable.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.546,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It went back years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.042,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His brother and a friend played those numbers in other states, for two point two million dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.05,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "His sentence was up to twenty-five years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.043,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "77a6cb1c2f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The sixteen and a half million was never paid.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.537,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cb8ee19c6475"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "His code beat a locked room.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.451,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cb8ee19c6475"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "A store camera beat him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.329,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "cb8ee19c6475"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t99",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So who checks the man who writes the numbers?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/tipton-lottery/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.889,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "bd52efa30e2b"
    }
  ]
}
